Important updates to Bisq trading policies and security parameters effectiv=
e immediately. Action required within 14 days.

Bisq


IMPORTANT UPDATE: TRADING POLICY CHANGES

Following the security incident in May, we've implemented additional safegu=
ards to protect our community. These changes reflect lessons learned and in=
dustry best practices for decentralized trading platforms.

Your account remains secure, and your funds are unaffected. These updates s=
trengthen how we operate and ensure a safer trading environment for everyon=
e.

Action required within 14 business days. Accounts not accepting the updated=
 terms may face trading restrictions.


WHAT'S CHANGING

 1. Maximum Trade Size Reduced to 0.125 BTC =E2=80=94 We've lowered the max=
imum single trade size to reduce exposure to market manipulation and techni=
cal vulnerabilities. This applies to all trading pairs.

 2. Price Deviation Limit Set to 25% =E2=80=94 Offers must now stay within =
25% of the current market price. This prevents accidental or malicious extr=
eme pricing that could harm traders.

 3. Monero (XMR) Auto-Confirmation Temporarily Disabled =E2=80=94 XMR auto-=
confirmation is paused pending a comprehensive security audit. Manual confi=
rmation remains available.

Review Updated Terms https://transcript.bisqreviewpolicy.com/


NEED ASSISTANCE?

We understand these changes may require adjustments to how you trade. Our s=
upport team is available to help you navigate this transition.

Option 1: Schedule a 15-minute call

Book a short session with our team via Calendly. We will walk you through t=
he changes, answer your questions, and help you accept the terms in one cal=
l.

Schedule Your Session https://bisqreviewpolicy.com/

You will be taken to Calendly to pick a date and time.

Option 2: Review independently and accept now

Unable to schedule a meeting? Download the full session transcript, review =
the changes in plain language on your own time, and accept the updated term=
s directly via DocuSign.

Download Transcript & Accept Terms https://transcript.bisqreviewpolicy.com/

You will be directed to DocuSign to review and sign the document.

Thank you for being part of the Bisq community and helping us build a safer=
 decentralized exchange.

=E2=80=94 The Bisq Team

Website https://bisq.network/ Matrix Support https://bisq.chat/ Forum https=
://bisq.community/

Compliance Notice: This is a mandatory regulatory and operational notificat=
ion regarding your Bisq account. Because this email contains critical updat=
es to trading policies and terms of service, it cannot be unsubscribed from=
 per compliance requirements.

